Package: furinar
Version: 0.1.0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Furinar Dev <dev@furinar.dev>
Homepage: https://github.com/LokKol17/furinar
Depends: libasound2, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64
Description: A light, fast, and beautiful audio player
 Furinar is a lightweight audio player inspired by the Hydro Archon.
 It opens in milliseconds and uses only 2-10 MB of RAM while covering
 everything a real player needs: tags, synced lyrics, multiple libraries,
 and native system integration.
 .
 Supports MP3, WAV, FLAC, OGG/Vorbis, and M4A.
 Features include multiple folder tabs, synced lyrics via .lrc files,
 light/dark themes, and MPRIS media controls.
